 .../UICommon/XDNetplay/BattleCustomizer.cpp   | 106 +++++++++++++++++-
 .../UICommon/XDNetplay/BattleCustomizer.h     |  10 +-
 Source/Core/UICommon/XDNetplay/Version.h      |   2 +-
 3 files changed, 114 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

